+# Run Everything Orchestrator
+
+This script invokes the various automation helpers in the repository to create provisioning issues, PRs,
+kick off smoke checks, bake/push golden images, trigger Triton tuning helpers, schedule HIL cadence,
+and schedule soak/chaos runs.
+
+Usage (locally):
+
+- Ensure you have a valid GITHUB_TOKEN with repo permissions and any other required secrets in env:
+  - DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL (for migration smoke)
+  - DOCKER_REGISTRY, DOCKER_USERNAME, DOCKER_PASSWORD, GOLDEN_IMAGE_TAG (for golden image push)
+  - ACME_HIL_URL, ACME_HIL_TOKEN (for HIL cadence)
+
+- Run:
+  GITHUB_TOKEN=<token> DATABASE_URL=<db> REDIS_URL=<redis> python ops/automation/run_everything.py --repo owner/repo
+
+CI:
+- A GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/run_all_automation.yml) is included. Trigger via the repository Actions UI.
+
+Warning:
+- Many steps modify repo (create PRs/issues) and trigger network/cluster actions. Run only when you intend to perform full automation.
